{
    "title": "Hy-Vee Fast & Fresh",
    "description": "Hy-Vee Fast & Fresh app offers quick access to a wide selection of fresh meals and snacks that you can quickly order and pick up on the go. Simply use the Hy-Vee Fast & Fresh app to conveniently search on-the-go meals and snacks, check gas prices, and find deals and coupons for your nearest Hy-Vee Fast & Fresh.\r\n\r\nOrder Meals To Go:\r\nSearch for fresh, ready-to-order fast food or snacks. Order for breakfast, lunch, dinner, or anytime between through the mobile app and pick up at your nearest Hy-Vee Fast & Fresh location.  \r\n\r\nCheck Fuel Prices & Redeem Rewards:\r\nEnter your location to find current gas prices at Hy-Vee Fast & Fresh locations near you. Check for fuel rewards and redeem when you fill up.\r\n\r\nFind Deals & Coupons:\r\nBrowse the latest meal and snack deals and coupons. Save money at your next Hy-Vee Fast & Fresh visit.\r\n\r\nYou can use the Hy-Vee Fast & Fresh app every time you fuel up for gas, want to order a fresh meal or snack, or to find the latest deals and coupons. \r\n\r\nApp Features:\r\n- No sign up or account required to order meals or check gas prices.\r\n- Free to use with a simple interface. \r\n- Find discounts on snacks and meals. \r\n- Find information on meals, deals, gas prices, and directions to your nearest Hy-Vee Fast and Fresh.\r\n\r\nThe Hy-Vee Fast & Fresh app is your digital assistant when it comes to finding the best prices on gas, snacks, and fast, fresh meals near you. Start saving today!\r\n\r\nBy downloading and using The Hy-Vee Fast & Fresh app, you agree to our terms and policies. Read more at: https://www.hy-vee.com/corporate/policy/hyvee-terms-of-use/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hy-Vee Fast &amp; Fresh app offers quick access to a wide selection of fresh meals and snacks that you can quickly order and pick up on the go. Simply use the Hy-Vee Fast &amp; Fresh app to conveniently search on-the-go meals and snacks, check gas prices, and find deals and coupons for your nearest Hy-Vee Fast &amp; Fresh.<br><br>Order Meals To Go:<br>Search for fresh, ready-to-order fast food or snacks. Order for breakfast, lunch, dinner, or anytime between through the mobile app and pick up at your nearest Hy-Vee Fast &amp; Fresh location.  <br><br>Check Fuel Prices &amp; Redeem Rewards:<br>Enter your location to find current gas prices at Hy-Vee Fast &amp; Fresh locations near you. Check for fuel rewards and redeem when you fill up.<br><br>Find Deals &amp; Coupons:<br>Browse the latest meal and snack deals and coupons. Save money at your next Hy-Vee Fast &amp; Fresh visit.<br><br>You can use the Hy-Vee Fast &amp; Fresh app every time you fuel up for gas, want to order a fresh meal or snack, or to find the latest deals and coupons. <br><br>App Features:<br>- No sign up or account required to order meals or check gas prices.<br>- Free to use with a simple interface. <br>- Find discounts on snacks and meals. <br>- Find information on meals, deals, gas prices, and directions to your nearest Hy-Vee Fast and Fresh.<br><br>The Hy-Vee Fast &amp; Fresh app is your digital assistant when it comes to finding the best prices on gas, snacks, and fast, fresh meals near you. Start saving today!<br><br>By downloading and using The Hy-Vee Fast &amp; Fresh app, you agree to our terms and policies. Read more at: https://www.hy-vee.com/corporate/policy/hyvee-terms-of-use/",
